+
+## 2. Response header rules (Rules → Transform Rules → Modify Response Header)
+Mirrors `public/_headers` (GitHub Pages ignores that file). One rule, all requests to www.easygradetool.com:
+| Operation | Header | Value |
+|---|---|---|
+| Set static | X-Content-Type-Options | nosniff |
+| Set static | X-Frame-Options | SAMEORIGIN |
+| Set static | Referrer-Policy | strict-origin-when-cross-origin |
+| Set static | Permissions-Policy | camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=() |
+| Set static | Strict-Transport-Security | max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains |
+
+Enable HSTS only after HTTPS works on every page (it is hard to undo; also available under SSL/TLS → Edge Certificates).
+
+## 3. Cache Rules (Caching → Cache Rules)
+- `starts_with(http.request.uri.path, "/assets/") or starts_with(http.request.uri.path, "/fonts/")` → Eligible for cache, Edge TTL 1 year, Browser TTL 1 year (files are hash-named / immutable).
+- `starts_with(http.request.uri.path, "/images/")` → Browser TTL 30 days.
+- Do **not** long-cache HTML, `/sw.js`, `/manifest.json`, `/sitemap.xml`.
+
+## 4. Check it worked
+```
+curl -sI https://www.easygradetool.com/curve-calculator | head -5      # expect 301 and Location: /grade-curve-calculator/
+curl -sI https://www.easygradetool.com/ | grep -iE "strict-transport|x-content-type|referrer-policy"
+curl -sI https://www.easygradetool.com/assets/<any hashed file> | grep -i cache-control
+```
+
+## 5. Search Console (not confirmed which method is in use)
+Prefer **Domain property + DNS TXT record** (works behind Cloudflare, needs no code change, survives redesigns). Only if you must use an HTML tag, send the tag and it will be added to the build.
